        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 1969P, Elite Collection Charlotte Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Charlotte Door Pull is available in 12 inch and 18 inch lengths. Choose from one of several popular finish color options. The Charlotte Door Handle is mounted using thru-bolts which go through the door to the other side with a visible bolt head. Omnia's 1969P Elite Collection Charlotte Pull is for residential doors as well as commercial applications.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Charlotte Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<b>1969P/305:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 13-1/8\" </li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Width: 19/32\" </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>1969P/457:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 19-1/8\" </li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Width: 19/32\" </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/charlotte-door-pull-back-to-back-pair-omnia-btb-1969p\"><b> Omnia 1969P Charlotte Back-To-Back Pull Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
